  <header class="intro">
    <p>Hey! Patrick here. I'm a DevRel on the Edge web platform team at Microsoft. You'll typically find me writing and talking about the good work which our team does in Chromium and for the web.<br>
    Previously, I've worked at Mozilla, on the Firefox DevTools team.<br>
    I'm part of the <a href="https://openwebdocs.org/">Open Web Docs</a> governing committee and a co-chair of the <a href="https://web-platform-dx.github.io/">W3C WebDX community group</a>.
    <p>I have more than 20 years of working experience with the web and have been a designer, web developer, software engineer, browser engineer, engineering manager, and product manager.</p>
